<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Petronas year net up 48.3 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Petronas year net up 48.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31</p>
<p>		    (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	     6,763.0    vs	4,562.0</p>
<p>    Turnover		22,254.0    vs     18,089.0</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	 8,564.0    vs	7,083.0</p>
<p>    Minorities     less    591.0    vs  less  388.0</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	1,087.0    vs	    3.0</p>
<p>    Total assets	  58,050.0    vs     48,135.0</p>
<p>Share capital and</p>
<p>    reserves		23,117.0    vs     19,195.0</p>
<p>Note - Full name of the state-owned oil corporation is Petroliam Nasional Bhd.</p>
<p>- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230 8911)</p>
</text>
